# Copy this file to .env for local development.
#
# Origin of the companion dashboard / block page. One variable drives both:
#
# 1. The manifest's `externally_connectable` entry (wxt.config.ts), which
#    lets the dashboard message the extension. Omitted when unset.
# 2. The runtime URLs bundled into the extension (src/helpers/config.ts):
#    the blocked-site redirect target and the popup's dashboard button.
#    Falls back to the production dashboard (https://quran.pandusudo.xyz)
#    when unset, so a bare local build still blocks correctly.
#
# WXT_WEB_URL=https://quran.pandusudo.xyz
